  "claim": "borg_update_map() (borg-update.c) sets ag->glyph and adds the grid to track_glyph only inside the square_isdisarmabletrap() branch. That predicate requires TRF_TRAP, which the glyph of warding and decoy kinds do not carry, so a visible Rune of Protection is never recorded. borg_danger() then gives no rune reduction for summoning on that grid, and borg_defend_aux_glyph() reads another rune onto it. The correction also enters the branch when map_info's remembered trap for the grid has TRF_GLYPH, and sets ag->trap only for a disarmable trap; the existing glyph test and tracking then run unchanged.",
